  "body_html": "<h1>Knapsack Auction Environment</h1>\n<p>A knapsack auction is a single-parameter mechanism equipped with public item\nweights and a total capacity constraint.</p>\n<p>The interface records the public item sizes, the capacity, weight and capacity\nsign assumptions, feasibility, and capacity-respecting allocation rules.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[EconCSLib PR #27, blueprint/src/content.tex, def:auction_knapsack_environment] EconCSLib pull request #27, https://github.com/gametheoryinlean/EconCSLib/pull/27. Migrated from the PR's old leanblueprint section into mdblueprint staged form.</li>\n</ul>",
